{"schema":1,"revision":93657719,"page":{"pageid":5939815,"title":"餡","displayTitle":"餡","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Piroshki.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Piroshki.JPG/250px-Piroshki.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"176\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Piroshki.JPG/500px-Piroshki.JPG?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3680\" data-file-height=\"2592\" /></a><figcaption>塞滿肉、蘑菇、米和洋蔥等餡料的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9A%AE%E7%BE%85%E4%BB%80%E5%9F%BA\" title=\"皮羅什基\">皮羅什基</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r88702941\">.mw-parser-output .template-facttext{color:inherit;margin:-.3em 0;padding:.3em 0}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .template-facttext{background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#eaecf0)}}</style><mark class=\"template-facttext\" title=\"需要提供文獻來源\"><b>餡</b>或稱<b>餡料</b>，是一種被填充於其他食物內空隙的食物，餡料的種類包括碎肉、豆類、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%AC%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"蔬果\">蔬果</a>等，而被填充的食物種類包括<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BA%B5%E5%8C%85\" title=\"麵包\">麵包</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%B3%95%E9%A4%85\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"糕餅\">糕餅</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%B6%E7%A6%BD\" title=\"家禽\">家禽</a>、蔬菜等。</mark><sup class=\"noprint Template-Fact\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:列明來源\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\" title=\"來源請求。\">&#91;來源請求&#93;</span></a></sup>例如<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%84%9F%E6%81%A9%E7%AF%80%E5%A4%A7%E9%A4%90\" title=\"感恩節大餐\">感恩節大餐</a>中的<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%AB%E9%9B%9E%E8%82%89\" title=\"火雞肉\">火雞</a>可能會用的芹菜、堅果和洋蔥做餡<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%8A%E5%B7%9D%E7%87%92\" title=\"今川燒\">今川燒</a>可能用紅豆或奶油做餡。<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A4%A1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/20px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/40px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1376\" /></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90\" title=\"維基共享資源\">維基共享資源</a>上的相關多媒體資源：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Filling_(food)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"commons:Category:Filling (food)\">餡</a></li></ul>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r92366446\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.1